{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cc89","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08902-6908-7901-ad83-4a5ad2f4cb7e"},"sequence":1183,"recorded_at":1780531400002361,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"c06b7799-3d10-4fbc-bddd-7d86f5813b0c","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"c06b7799-3d10-4fbc-bddd-7d86f5813b0c","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"c06b7799-3d10-4fbc-bddd-7d86f5813b0c"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a08906-d678-7972-b0b9-6d9742ba65bc"},"task_id":"01a08906-d678-7972-b0b9-6d9742ba65bc","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a08906-d678-7972-b0b9-6d9742ba65bc","chunk":"Read text file `internal/sessquery/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n(119 line(s) above)\n120|revalidations return identical values. This establishes read\n121|idempotency and composition with existing recovery, not a new crash\n122|protocol.\n123|\n124|## Stated bounds (not implementations)\n125|\n126|- `lease_record_id` binds the canonical digest of the validated\n127|  winning `urn:ax:schema:lease` Lease Record for the selected\n128|  session, admitted from `Reader.LeaseRecords` through the\n129|  session-persistence owner (`sessrepo.AttestLeaseRecord` →\n130|  canonicaljson closed shape plus canonical self identity; greatest\n131|  (epoch, lease_id) winner with a fully validated succession\n132|  selected in `sessquery`: the predecessor ancestry chains by epoch\n133|  plus one to an epoch-1 null-predecessor root, and the winner\n134|  references an admitted `urn:ax:schema:checkpoint` Checkpoint\n135|  Record from `Reader.CheckpointRecords` through\n136|  `sessrepo.AttestCheckpointRecord` for its session and predecessor\n137|  lease, itself bound at epoch 1). The winning triple binds from\n138|  that same record; envelope triples never substitute for it. A\n139|  session with no admitted winning record refuses\n140|  selector_observation_unavailable; a complete read proving no lease\n141|  refuses selector_bootstrap_incomplete instead of binding an empty\n142|  triple. The provhost no-attestation-outside-the-leaf bound now\n143|  allowlists five session-leaf sites (the two entry decodes, the\n144|  load re-verification, and both record attestations).\n145|- `authority_heads` binds the sorted unique validated lease, event,\n146|  and tombstone heads used for the decision: the winning Lease\n147|  Record digest plus the tail event digest of every allowed source\n148|  holding a non-parked copy of the pinned session. The complete\n149|  authority union (same record, current tombstones, greatest winning\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
