{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cc8d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08902-6908-7901-ad83-4a5ad2f4cb7e"},"sequence":1185,"recorded_at":1780531400002365,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"c06b7799-3d10-4fbc-bddd-7d86f5813b0c","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"c06b7799-3d10-4fbc-bddd-7d86f5813b0c","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"c06b7799-3d10-4fbc-bddd-7d86f5813b0c"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a08906-d654-7442-8fc6-33c7a88912de"},"task_id":"01a08906-d654-7442-8fc6-33c7a88912de","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a08906-d654-7442-8fc6-33c7a88912de","chunk":"Read text file `README.md`.\n(1859 line(s) above)\n1860|- Immutable plans: `Reader.BuildPlan` binds all sixteen §14.7.2\n1861|  members — the literal selector, session and validated record digest,\n1862|  source host (always a UUIDv7; a local selection without a known local\n1863|  host refuses `invalid_config`) and exact alias, index and\n1864|  configuration digests, the validated winning `urn:ax:schema:lease`\n1865|  Lease Record digest with its epoch, lease ID, and holder from that\n1866|  same record (admitted through the canonicaljson owner from\n1867|  `Reader.LeaseRecords`, greatest (epoch, lease_id) winner with a\n1868|  fully validated succession: the predecessor ancestry chains by\n1869|  epoch plus one to an epoch-1 null-predecessor root, and the winner\n1870|  references an admitted `urn:ax:schema:checkpoint` Checkpoint Record\n1871|  from `Reader.CheckpointRecords` for its session and predecessor\n1872|  lease; no envelope observation substitutes for it),\n1873|  lease/event/tombstone authority heads (winning lease digest plus\n1874|  every non-parked source tail, sorted unique), action, destination,\n1875|  and expectation digest. A session with no admitted winning record\n1876|  refuses `selector_observation_unavailable`; a complete read proving\n1877|  a record without any valid lease refuses\n1878|  `selector_bootstrap_incomplete` instead of binding an empty triple.\n1879|  `Reader.Revalidate` compares every bound fact in a fixed order and\n1880|  validates the complete authority union for the pinned UUID across\n1881|  the local and every allowlisted source — contradictory records are\n1882|  `integrity_failure`, a greater winning lease and fresh tombstone\n1883|  evidence are `selector_plan_stale` while lagging copies stay\n1884|  current, and a parked copy of the pinned session in any required\n1885|  source fails the union closed with\n1886|  `selector_observation_unavailable` (never evidence, never absence)\n1887|  — without re-resolving names or substituting selections.\n1888|  Revocation is `peer_not_allowlisted`, and reads keep their classes.\n1889|  Plans authorize read projection only; fencing, commit, and remote\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
