  m                      Execute a mutation (write operation)\\n  migrate-keychain       Import legacy remote credentials into macOS Keychain\\n  migrate-project-config Preview or apply guarded deprecated project-config alias migration\\n  plan                   Show execution plan with phases and critical path\\n  q                      Query the board with a mini DSL\\n  repair-links           List or remove unsupported container dependency links\\n  resource               Upload, update, download, and delete board resources\\n  self-update            Update task-board to the latest version\\n  session                Inspect and stop Task-board Session Manager sessions\\n  spawn                  Queue an agent spawn run for a board task\\n  switch-user            Switch active user for current remote\\n  tree                   Show board as hierarchical tree\\n  tui                    Launch interactive TUI\\n  validate               Validate board structure\\n  whoami                 Show current remote and active user\\n  worktree               Inspect and repair managed Story workspaces\\n\\nFlags:\\n      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n===\\n{\\\"defaultFields\\\":[\\\"id\\\",\\\"name\\\",\\\"status\\\"],\\\"fields\\\":[\\\"id\\\",\\\"type\\\",\\\"name\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"status\\\",\\\"integrationCheckpointed\\\",\\\"review\\\",\\\"task_class\\\",\\\"estimate\\\",\\\"observability\\\",\\\"parent\\\",\\\"assignee\\\",\\\"description\\\",\\\"scope\\\",\\\"ac\\\",\\\"blockedBy\\\",\\\"blocks\\\",\\\"derivedBlockedBy\\\",\\\"derivedBlocks\\\",\\\"checklist\\\",\\\"notes\\\",\\\"created\\\",\\\"updated\\\",\\\"isBlocked\\\",\\\"isAdvisoryBlocked\\\",\\\"children\\\",\\\"preconditionResources\\\",\\\"outcomeResources\\\",\\\"identity\\\",\\\"binding\\\",\\\"lineage\\\",\\\"lifecycle\\\",\\\"freshness\\\",\\\"actualization\\\",\\\"security\\\",\\\"payload\\\"],\\\"grammar\\\":{\\\"statement\\\":\\\"OPERATION(ARGUMENTS) { PROJECTION }; the projection block is optional\\\",\\\"batch\\\":\\\"STATEMENT; STATEMENT — statements separated by ';', results keep source order\\\",\\\"arguments\\\":\\\"comma-separated arguments: the first bare positional value is the element/identifier argument; remaining arguments use key=value; no operators or lists (not key in [a,b], not key!=value)\\\",\\\"values\\\":\\\"a bare identifier (letters, digits, '_', '-', '.', '/'), an int, a bool (true|false), or a \\\\\\\"double-quoted string\\\\\\\"; quote any value containing spaces, commas or parentheses\\\",\\\"escapes\\\":[\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\"\\\\\\\\n\\\",\\\"\\\\\\\\t\\\"],\\\"projection\\\":\\\"field projection: { field preset ... } — space-separated field names and preset names inside braces; omitted means the default fields\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":[\\\"identifier\\\",\\\"string\\\",\\\"'('\\\",\\\"')'\\\",\\\"'{'\\\",\\\"'}'\\\",\\\"'='\\\",\\\"','\\\",\\\"';'\\\",\\\"end of input\\\"],\\\"examples\\\":[\\\"op()\\\",\\\"op(key=value)\\\",\\\"op(key=value, other=42, flag=true)\\\",\\\"op(key=\\\\\\\"quoted value with \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ \\\\\\\\n \\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\")\\\",\\\"op(positional)\\\",\\\"op() { field preset }\\\",\\\"op(\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3932,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 983,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
